Package: RoCE
Type: Package
Title: RoCE: Robust Federated Causal Estimation through Calibrated High-Dimensional Models
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-08-25
Authors@R: 
    person("Sinian", "Zhang", 
           email = "zhan9381@umn.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Sinian Zhang [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Sinian Zhang <zhan9381@umn.edu>
Description: Estimates target treatment effects from multi-site data using
    calibrated nuisance models and adaptive source aggregation. Supports joint
    treatment-arm optimization, two- or three-layer cross-fitting, one- or
    two-round communication, C++ solvers, and causal estimation baselines.
